  "description": "The Apogee One is an innovative 140mm trail bike that features our precision-machined Free Float Module suspension and handmade steel DuoFrame. It’s a modern classic that pairs advanced suspension kinematics with a frame that’s specifically tuned for a smooth and playful ride.\nEach frame is hand-welded, machined, and built exclusively in the Pacific Northwest, USA. See more about how it's made.\nTo order a frameset only, simply Size and Color, but leave the other fields blank. You can also select \"None / Frame Only\" in the additional fields. Upon ordering, we'll reach out to confirm your build reservation and timing. Production typically takes about 4 months.\nAll colors come with a Gunmetal Gray Free Float Module. Contact us at admin@apogee.bike for bespoke build options and pricing.",
